{
    "title": "SiriusXM: Music, Sports & News",
    "description": "Expand your listening universe with SiriusXM. Tune in to live radio, ad-free music, news, sports, comedy, and podcasts. SiriusXM is better than ever \u2013 getting you closer to your favorite stars with new and improved listening.\r\n\r\nTurn on the holidays and ring in the season with SiriusXM. Celebrate with curated music channels from Jimmy Fallon\u2019s Holiday Seasoning Radio to app-exclusive Jolly Christmas. Listen to festive genres \u2013 holiday pop, seasonal R&B, and country Christmas music.\r\n\r\nStream live play-by-play for your team, including NFL, NBA, & NHL\u00ae. Catch the latest college football matchup, with broadcasts from the country\u2019s top conferences. From live games to in-depth talk radio analysis, SiriusXM is the ultimate destination for sports fans.\r\n\r\nExplore expertly curated entertainment with SiriusXM \u2013 the ultimate ad-free music, podcast, & radio app. Rediscover old favorites, discover new favorites to love, & listen to your world get bigger. \r\n\r\nSiriusXM Features*\r\n\r\nOnline Music Streaming\r\n- Listen to SiriusXM\u2019s extensive music library with exclusive channels \u2013 The Beatles, Bruce Springsteen, Carrie Underwood, Dave Matthews Band, Diplo, Disney Hits, Drake, Eminem, Eric Church, John Mayer, Kelly Clarkson, Kenny Chesney, LL COOL J, Pearl Jam, Red Hot Chili Peppers, Shaggy, Smokey Robinson, Steve Aoki, U2 & more\r\n\r\nLive Sports Radio & Analysis\r\n- Get the latest scores & live radio broadcast for your favorite team\r\n- Stream play-by-play of every major professional sport PLUS expert talk & analysis \u2013 NFL, MLB\u00ae, NBA, NHL\u00ae, the PGA TOUR\u00ae, & NASCAR\u00ae\r\n- Tune in to games from top NCAA\u00ae conferences \u2013 ACC, SEC, Big 12, Big Ten & more\r\n- ESPN Radio, NBC Sports Audio, FOX Sports Radio, & CBS Sports Radio in just a few taps\r\n- Listen to sports talk radio for news, fantasy sports analysis, & more\r\n\r\nNews, Talk Shows, Podcasts & Comedy\r\n- Hear live news from all angles \u2013 FOX News, CNN, MSNBC, FOX Business, CNBC, Bloomberg Radio, C-SPAN, NPR Now & more\r\n- Catch Nikki Haley\u2019s political talk show, now through the presidential inauguration\r\n- Listen to Howard Stern episodes on two exclusive channels*\r\n- Stream unscripted talk radio with A-list hosts \u2013 Andy Cohen, Conan O\u2019Brien, & TODAY Show Radio\r\n- Laugh along to exclusive comedy \u2013 Kevin Hart\u2019s LOL Radio, Netflix Is A Joke Radio, Comedy Central Radio, & more\r\n\r\nListen to Your Favorites\r\n- Save and organize everything you love listening to with Your Library \u2013 music & podcasts, artists & bands to teams & leagues\r\n- Never miss a moment \u2013 get alerts when your shows, episodes, or game-day programs go live\r\n\r\nDiscover More of What You Love\r\n- Expand your listening universe with customized recommendations\r\n- Explore dedicated pages for teams, genres, artists, channels, & more\r\n- Browse through SiriusXM channels on our channel guide\r\n\r\nStreaming Made For You\r\n- Stay connected to the SiriusXM app on the road via Android Auto\r\n- Listen everywhere on your favorite smart speaker or app-enabled device\r\n- Cast from your phone or tablet for seamless listening on your TV, soundbar, or speaker\r\n\r\n*Some programming includes explicit language.\r\nAll features and content vary by plan and are subject to change.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION OFFER DETAILS: Upon purchase of any plan, your subscription will AUTOMATICALLY RENEW and you will be charged (after any free trial) the rate + applicable tax on a recurring monthly basis until you cancel. Cancel at least 24-hours before any renewal date in your account to avoid future charges. No refunds or credits, unless permitted by your billing platform. Promotional offers are for new subscribers only. All fees, content, and features may change. The SiriusXM app is made available to you by Sirius XM Radio Inc. Use of the SiriusXM app is limited to the United States and certain U.S. territories and is subject to the SiriusXM Customer Agreement at siriusxm.com/customeragreement. Some restrictions apply. Data charges may apply.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: siriusxm.com/privacy\r\nYour Privacy Choices: siriusxm.com/yourprivacychoices",
    "descriptionHTML": "Expand your listening universe with SiriusXM. Tune in to live radio, ad-free music, news, sports, comedy, and podcasts. SiriusXM is better than ever \u2013 getting you closer to your favorite stars with new and improved listening.<br><br>Turn on the holidays and ring in the season with SiriusXM. Celebrate with curated music channels from Jimmy Fallon\u2019s Holiday Seasoning Radio to app-exclusive Jolly Christmas. Listen to festive genres \u2013 holiday pop, seasonal R&amp;B, and country Christmas music.<br><br>Stream live play-by-play for your team, including NFL, NBA, &amp; NHL\u00ae. Catch the latest college football matchup, with broadcasts from the country\u2019s top conferences. From live games to in-depth talk radio analysis, SiriusXM is the ultimate destination for sports fans.<br><br>Explore expertly curated entertainment with SiriusXM \u2013 the ultimate ad-free music, podcast, &amp; radio app. Rediscover old favorites, discover new favorites to love, &amp; listen to your world get bigger. <br><br>SiriusXM Features*<br><br>Online Music Streaming<br>- Listen to SiriusXM\u2019s extensive music library with exclusive channels \u2013 The Beatles, Bruce Springsteen, Carrie Underwood, Dave Matthews Band, Diplo, Disney Hits, Drake, Eminem, Eric Church, John Mayer, Kelly Clarkson, Kenny Chesney, LL COOL J, Pearl Jam, Red Hot Chili Peppers, Shaggy, Smokey Robinson, Steve Aoki, U2 &amp; more<br><br>Live Sports Radio &amp; Analysis<br>- Get the latest scores &amp; live radio broadcast for your favorite team<br>- Stream play-by-play of every major professional sport PLUS expert talk &amp; analysis \u2013 NFL, MLB\u00ae, NBA, NHL\u00ae, the PGA TOUR\u00ae, &amp; NASCAR\u00ae<br>- Tune in to games from top NCAA\u00ae conferences \u2013 ACC, SEC, Big 12, Big Ten &amp; more<br>- ESPN Radio, NBC Sports Audio, FOX Sports Radio, &amp; CBS Sports Radio in just a few taps<br>- Listen to sports talk radio for news, fantasy sports analysis, &amp; more<br><br>News, Talk Shows, Podcasts &amp; Comedy<br>- Hear live news from all angles \u2013 FOX News, CNN, MSNBC, FOX Business, CNBC, Bloomberg Radio, C-SPAN, NPR Now &amp; more<br>- Catch Nikki Haley\u2019s political talk show, now through the presidential inauguration<br>- Listen to Howard Stern episodes on two exclusive channels*<br>- Stream unscripted talk radio with A-list hosts \u2013 Andy Cohen, Conan O\u2019Brien, &amp; TODAY Show Radio<br>- Laugh along to exclusive comedy \u2013 Kevin Hart\u2019s LOL Radio, Netflix Is A Joke Radio, Comedy Central Radio, &amp; more<br><br>Listen to Your Favorites<br>- Save and organize everything you love listening to with Your Library \u2013 music &amp; podcasts, artists &amp; bands to teams &amp; leagues<br>- Never miss a moment \u2013 get alerts when your shows, episodes, or game-day programs go live<br><br>Discover More of What You Love<br>- Expand your listening universe with customized recommendations<br>- Explore dedicated pages for teams, genres, artists, channels, &amp; more<br>- Browse through SiriusXM channels on our channel guide<br><br>Streaming Made For You<br>- Stay connected to the SiriusXM app on the road via Android Auto<br>- Listen everywhere on your favorite smart speaker or app-enabled device<br>- Cast from your phone or tablet for seamless listening on your TV, soundbar, or speaker<br><br>*Some programming includes explicit language.<br>All features and content vary by plan and are subject to change.<br><br>SUBSCRIPTION OFFER DETAILS: Upon purchase of any plan, your subscription will AUTOMATICALLY RENEW and you will be charged (after any free trial) the rate + applicable tax on a recurring monthly basis until you cancel. Cancel at least 24-hours before any renewal date in your account to avoid future charges. No refunds or credits, unless permitted by your billing platform. Promotional offers are for new subscribers only. All fees, content, and features may change. The SiriusXM app is made available to you by Sirius XM Radio Inc. Use of the SiriusXM app is limited to the United States and certain U.S. territories and is subject to the SiriusXM Customer Agreement at siriusxm.com/customeragreement. Some restrictions apply. Data charges may apply.<br><br>Privacy Policy: siriusxm.com/privacy<br>Your Privacy Choices: siriusxm.com/yourprivacychoices",
